{% raw %}<section class="band band-photo band-photo-text"><img src="/images/2018/06/Purestyle_Blog-hero.webp" alt="Grey kitchen with an island, pendant lights and an exposed brick wall" width="1200" height="766" fetchpriority="high" class="band-img"><div class="wrap"><div class="band-card"><div class="el-block"><h2>PureStyle</h2></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>Introducing PureStyle.</h2><div class="el-text"><p>PureStyle is a cabinetry material that combines the durability of laminate and the beauty of paint. Environmentally friendly and extremely stable, each component of the 5-piece construction is continuously wrapped to achieve a flawless appearance.  The end result of PureStyle laminate are cabinets with clean, crisp details and a quality finish that will last a lifetime. Watch the video below to learn more.</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="video"><iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/abZYLNmeOLg" title="Purestyle video" loading="lazy" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>The Benefits of PureStyle.</h2></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="el-row" style="--cols:33fr 33fr 33fr"><div class="el-col"><div class="icon-box"><h3>5-Piece Construction</h3><div class="el-text">Purestyle features a true 5-piece construction that emulates the look of painted wood cabinets. Each component is continuously wrapped, reducing the potential for moisture to enter and delamination to occur.</div></div></div><div class="el-col"><div class="icon-box"><h3>Exceptional Finish</h3><div class="el-text">PureStyle laminates offer a smooth finish that is color consistent and won't crack or craze like painted wood products. With benefits exceeding those of paint, dollar for dollar, PureStyle delivers maximum value.</div></div></div><div class="el-col"><div class="icon-box"><h3>Environmentally Safe</h3><div class="el-text">PureStyle cabinets are cellulose-based and contain no toxic substances. The substrates are Medium Density Fiberboard (MDF), made from wood that comes from forests with eco-sustainable systems</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><h2>PureStyle vs. Paint</h2><div class="el-text"><p>When it comes to addressing the most common cabinetry issues, PureStyle is the winner!</p></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="progress"><span>Resistance to Moisture and Humidity</span><span class="bar"><span style="width:90%"></span></span></div><div class="progress"><span></span><span class="bar"><span style="width:40%"></span></span></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="progress"><span>Resistance to Dents, Nicks &amp; Scratches</span><span class="bar"><span style="width:80%"></span></span></div><div class="progress"><span></span><span class="bar"><span style="width:55%"></span></span></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="progress"><span>Resistance to Warping and Open Joints</span><span class="bar"><span style="width:100%"></span></span></div><div class="progress"><span></span><span class="bar"><span style="width:45%"></span></span></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="progress"><span>Resistance to Scuff Marks, Crayon and Grease</span><span class="bar"><span style="width:100%"></span></span></div><div class="progress"><span></span><span class="bar"><span style="width:55%"></span></span></div></div></section><section class="band"><div class="wrap"><div class="progress"><span>Consistency of Finish</span><span class="bar"><span style="width:80%"></span></span></div><div class="progress"><span></span><span class="bar"><span style="width:35%"></span></span></div></div></section>{% endraw %}
